    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introduction \r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a bright and generously proportioned two-bedroom apartment in the popular Tannery development on Cork Street. Situated on the first floor and enjoying its own-door entrance, this impressive apartment offers well-balanced accommodation with excellent natural light throughout. The property benefits from particularly large windows, allowing natural light to stream into the apartment and creating a bright, welcoming atmosphere. The heart of the home is the large open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, providing an excellent space for both everyday living and entertaining. From the living area, doors open directly onto a large private balcony, extending the living space outdoors and providing a pleasant area to relax or entertain.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is generously proportioned and features its own en-suite bathroom, as well as direct access to the balcony — a particularly attractive feature. The second bedroom is also a good-sized double bedroom and is complemented by a separate main bathroom. A generous laundry/storage room provides valuable additional storage and practical utility space, helping to keep the apartment well organised. The accommodation is complemented by the apartment's excellent sense of space and natural brightness, with the large windows and dual-aspect access to the balcony enhancing the overall feeling of openness. Accommodation briefly comprises own-door entrance, entrance hall, large open-plan living/dining area, kitchen, large balcony, two double bedrooms (master en-suite), main bathroom and generous laundry/storage room. An attractive property offering bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation in a convenient Dublin 8 location, which should appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nLocation \r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with the apartment situated on Cork Street in the heart of Dublin 8 and Lidl located immediately beside the development, making the weekly grocery shop quite literally just moments from your front door. The area offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities, while Dublin city centre is within easy reach. There are also excellent transport connections nearby, including the Luas Red Line and a range of Dublin Bus routes, providing easy access throughout the city. The location is further enhanced by its proximity to St James's Hospital, the Coombe Hospital and the National Children's Hospital, making it particularly appealing to medical  and those working in the surrounding area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway: 5.40m x 1.15m + 1.50m x 1.60m: Spacious reception hallway with phone intercom, timber flooring and access to large hot press. \r\n\r\nLarge Laundry/Storage Room: 2.65m x 1.15m: Clothes Washing Machine, Shelving & Timber Flooring. \r\n\r\nVery Large Open Plan Living Room & Dining Area: 5.25m x 5.15m: Timber flooring, large, frosted window & Door to large balcony.\r\n\r\nBalcony: 4.05m x 2.05m: Decking & access doors from living and master bedroom.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.25m x 2.00m: Excellent selection of floor & wall units with countertops, wall tiling, timber flooring, built in hob, cooker & extractor fan. Stainless steel sink & draining board. Free standing fridge freezer. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom En-Suite: 5.40m x 4.65m (mm): Timber flooring & built in floor to ceiling wardrobes and drawers. Large, frosted window and access to large balcony. \r\n\r\nEn-Suite: Comprises large step in shower, w.h.b & w.c. Floor & wall tiling with towel hangers, extractor fan and wall mounted showing light and sockets. Dimplex wall heater.\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2: 4.00m x 2.75m: floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, timber flooring & large picture window making for extremely bright room \r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.30m x 1.90m: Compressor bath with shower attachment, W.H.B & W.C. Wall & floor tiling. Toiletries shelf, Dimplex wall heater & shaving light & sockets. \r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nCommon area gardens laid out in patio, walkways and mature plants & shrubs. Secure underground car parking"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approximately 94 Sq. m including balcony area \r\n\r\nDesignated car parking space \r\n\r\nFirst-floor two-bedroom apartment with own-door access\r\n\r\nExceptionally bright accommodation with large windows throughout\r\n\r\nSpacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area\r\n\r\nLarge private balcony with access from both living room and master bedroom\r\n\r\nGenerous master bedroom with en-suite bathroom\r\n\r\nWell-proportioned second double bedroom\r\n\r\nGenerous laundry and storage room\r\n\r\nExcellent natural light throughout the apartment\r\n\r\nLidl supermarket located immediately beside the development\r\n\r\nConvenient Dublin 8 location within easy reach of the city centre"
      },
