      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Dublin city centre, travel south along Patrick Street and continue onto Cork Street. Continue along Cork Street towards Dolphin’s Barn, with The Tannery located on the left-hand side, immediately beside Lidl. The development is conveniently located approximately 1.5 km from St Stephen’s Green and is easily accessible from the South Circular Road and Dublin city centre."
